OL,3,GNEWSAWhat you need to know about
OL,4,Aupcoming M5 closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorway will be closed overnight
OL,7,Fwhile its central safety barrier is
OL,8,Freplaced.
OL,10,FWork on the M5 between junctions 25 and
OL,11,F26 near Taunton in Somerset will begin
OL,12,Fon Monday and is not due to be
OL,13,Fcompleted until July.
OL,15,FNational Highways said the barrier on
OL,16,Fthe stretch of motorway had "reached
OL,17,Fthe end of its life" and needed to be
OL,18,Freplaced.
OL,20,FSigned diversion routes will be in
OL,21,Fplace via the A38 between Wellington
OL,22,Fand Taunton during full closures.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
